		<description><![CDATA[I was blessed to live with the Corletts to assist during Shirley&#039;s last months.  Shirley was a warm, loving woman who bore her illness with great strength and dignity.  She had a delightful sense of humor and a love of animals and nature as celebrated in the Native American tradition which she revered along with the Sufi teachings.
Her courage and selflessness will always be an inspiration to me.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I was blessed to live with the Corletts to assist during Shirley&#8217;s last months.  Shirley was a warm, loving woman who bore her illness with great strength and dignity.  She had a delightful sense of humor and a love of animals and nature as celebrated in the Native American tradition which she revered along with the Sufi teachings.<br />
Her courage and selflessness will always be an inspiration to me.</p>
